## Pixel art for every creature: the hero, foes and bosses. A frame is a list
## of rows, one letter per pixel, standing on its bottom row, facing right (it
## is mirrored when facing left) and centred on the creature. Digits are the
## creature's palette, a-j darker and A-J lighter shades of colours 0-9, other
## letters shared colours (see sprite_cache.gd) and "." is see-through; the
## dark outline is added when the frame becomes a texture.
extends RefCounted

